codex
The root cause is now concrete: Lean’s runtime calls `readlink("/proc/2/exe")`, but the sandbox’s proc mount exposes the process only through `/proc/self/exe`, so the lookup returns `ENOENT`. I’m applying a narrow audit-local preload shim that retries only failed `/proc/<pid>/exe` lookups as `/proc/self/exe`; it does not alter the generated project, theorem data, or compiler.
apply patch
